msgstr "Daily Brief vs Personal Briefs"

#: app/templates/help/daily_brief.html:31
msgid ""
"The Daily Brief is curated by Society Speaks from our 140+ source library. "
"Personal Briefs are paid, custom digests built from sources you choose — and"
" subscriptions fund the free civic platform."
msgstr ""
"O Daily Brief é curado pelo Society Speaks de nossa biblioteca de 140+ "
"fontes. Personal Briefs são resumos personalizados pagos construídos a "
"partir de fontes que você escolhe — e as assinaturas financiam a plataforma "
"cívica gratuita."

